{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51191","headline":"兀然无事（原卷缺题，不分篇段，现将分爲十一首） 十 · 王梵志","name":"兀然无事（原卷缺题，不分篇段，现将分爲十一首） 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"世事悠悠，不如山丘。\n青松蔽日，碧涧常秋。\n山云当幕，夜月爲钩。\n卧藤萝下，块石枕头。\n不朝天子，岂羡王侯？\n生死无虑，更复何忧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51191.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51191","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}